{"sectionId":"immune/innate","items":[{"id":"immune--innate-k001","sectionId":"immune/innate","unitId":"immune","subject":"biology","text":"선천면역은 장벽, 식세포, NK세포, 보체 및 염증 매개체로 구성된다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"immune--innate-k002","sectionId":"immune/innate","unitId":"immune","subject":"biology","text":"PRR은 PAMP 또는 DAMP를 인식한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"immune--innate-k003","sectionId":"immune/innate","unitId":"immune","subject":"biology","text":"TLR4는 LPS 인식에 관여하고 세포질 RIG-I 계열은 바이러스 RNA를 감지한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"immune--innate-k004","sectionId":"immune/innate","unitId":"immune","subject":"biology","text":"호중구는 빠른 식균과 미생물 제거, 대식세포는 식균·사이토카인 분비·조직 항상성, 수지상세포는 항원 제시와 초기 T세포 활성화에 중요하다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"immune--innate-k005","sectionId":"immune/innate","unitId":"immune","subject":"biology","text":"비만세포는 histamine 등으로 혈관 반응에 관여한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"immune--innate-k006","sectionId":"immune/innate","unitId":"immune","subject":"biology","text":"보체의 고전 경로는 항체와 관련된 C1 활성화, 렉틴 경로는 MBL, 대체 경로는 C3의 자발적 활성화와 표면 증폭에 의해 시작될 수 있다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"immune--innate-k007","sectionId":"immune/innate","unitId":"immune","subject":"biology","text":"세 경로는 C3 convertase로 수렴한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"immune--innate-k008","sectionId":"immune/innate","unitId":"immune","subject":"biology","text":"C3b는 opsonization, C3a와 C5a는 염증, C5a는 강한 화학주성, C5b-9는 MAC 형성에 중요하다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"immune--innate-k009","sectionId":"immune/innate","unitId":"immune","subject":"biology","text":"type I IFN(α,β)은 항바이러스 상태를 유도한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"immune--innate-k010","sectionId":"immune/innate","unitId":"immune","subject":"biology","text":"NK세포는 MHC I 감소 및 활성화 리간드 등의 균형을 감지하여 perforin과 granzyme으로 표적을 죽인다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"immune--innate-k011","sectionId":"immune/innate","unitId":"immune","subject":"biology","text":"C3b: 옵소닌, C3a/C5a: 염증, C5b-9: MAC.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"immune--innate-k012","sectionId":"immune/innate","unitId":"immune","subject":"biology","text":"NK세포는 CD8 T세포처럼 재배열된 항원 특이 TCR을 사용하지 않는다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"immune--innate-k013","sectionId":"immune/innate","unitId":"immune","subject":"biology","text":"I형 인터페론과 IFN-γ(type II)를 구별한다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"immune--innate-k014","sectionId":"immune/innate","unitId":"immune","subject":"biology","text":"혈관 확장·투과성 증가·백혈구 유입은 염증의 주요 요소다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"immune--innate-k015","sectionId":"immune/innate","unitId":"immune","subject":"biology","text":"C3이다.","kind":"review-answer","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]}]}